From ccb75d03135946f641542482c6973566a56dd176 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stefano Castagnetta <scastagnetta@nvidia.com>
Date: Mon, 15 Jun 2026 02:29:51 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Remove royalty-bearing codecs (H.264/H.265/AAC); add
 codec-safe FFmpeg + opencv strip

Signed-off-by: Stefano Castagnetta <scastagnetta@nvidia.com>
---
 docker/Dockerfile                             |  28 ++-
 docker/Dockerfile.cpu                         |  37 +++-
 docker/Dockerfile.nightly_torch               |  27 ++-
